  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Expenditure Verification of the Contract ENOUGH! HUM/2018/400-610&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;The Expenditure Verifier is expected to: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;Carry out the agreed-upon procedures listed in Annex 2 and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;Issue reports based on the template in Annex 3 which will support the Contracting Authority&apos;s conclusions on the eligibility of the reported expenditure and the related follow-up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
